{"seq":2,"slug":"internal-developer-platform","title":"内部开发者平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/platform-foundations/internal-developer-platform","wordCount":1027,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"内部开发者平台\">内部开发者平台</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>内部开发者平台（Internal Developer Platform，IDP）是平台工程的核心产出物。它是一套整合了工具、服务和工作流的自助式平台层，让开发者能够独立完成从代码提交到生产部署的全流程，无需依赖运维工单或外部团队协助。</p>\n<p>IDP 的本质是在底层基础设施（云服务、Kubernetes、数据库等）和上层应用开发者之间构建一个精心设计的抽象层。这一层既要屏蔽不必要的复杂性，又要保留必要的灵活性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 开发者界面层&#10;        A[开发者门户]&#10;        B[CLI 工具]&#10;        C[API 接口]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 平台编排层&#10;        D[黄金路径引擎]&#10;        E[策略执行器]&#10;        F[资源编排器]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 基础设施层&#10;        G[Kubernetes]&#10;        H[云服务 API]&#10;        I[监控系统]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; D&#10;    B --&gt; D&#10;    C --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    F --&gt; I\">graph TB\n    subgraph 开发者界面层\n        A[开发者门户]\n        B[CLI 工具]\n        C[API 接口]\n    end\n    subgraph 平台编排层\n        D[黄金路径引擎]\n        E[策略执行器]\n        F[资源编排器]\n    end\n    subgraph 基础设施层\n        G[Kubernetes]\n        H[云服务 API]\n        I[监控系统]\n    end\n    A --&gt; D\n    B --&gt; D\n    C --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; H\n    F --&gt; I</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>自建脚本</th>\n<th>云厂商控制台</th>\n<th>IDP</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一致性</td>\n<td>团队各异</td>\n<td>云厂商锁定</td>\n<td>统一标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自助程度</td>\n<td>需运维介入</td>\n<td>部分自助</td>\n<td>完全自助</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抽象层次</td>\n<td>无抽象</td>\n<td>云资源级别</td>\n<td>业务语义级别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可扩展性</td>\n<td>难以维护</td>\n<td>受限于厂商</td>\n<td>插件化扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合规内置</td>\n<td>手动检查</td>\n<td>部分内置</td>\n<td>策略即代码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"idp-五大核心组件\">IDP 五大核心组件</h2><p>一个成熟的 IDP 通常由五大核心组件构成：应用配置管理、基础设施编排、环境管理、部署管理和角色访问控制。这些组件协同工作，覆盖应用生命周期的各个阶段。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface IDPComponents {&#10;  applicationConfig: {&#10;    purpose: &#39;定义应用需要的资源和依赖&#39;;&#10;    tools: [&#39;Score&#39;, &#39;Helm Charts&#39;, &#39;Kustomize&#39;];&#10;    artifact: &#39;Workload Specification&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  infrastructureOrchestration: {&#10;    purpose: &#39;将声明式配置转化为实际资源&#39;;&#10;    tools: [&#39;Terraform&#39;, &#39;Crossplane&#39;, &#39;Pulumi&#39;];&#10;    artifact: &#39;Provisioned Resources&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  environmentManagement: {&#10;    purpose: &#39;管理开发/预发/生产环境&#39;;&#10;    tools: [&#39;Humanitec&#39;, &#39;Backstage&#39;, &#39;自研&#39;];&#10;    artifact: &#39;Environment Instance&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  deploymentManagement: {&#10;    purpose: &#39;编排发布流程&#39;;&#10;    tools: [&#39;ArgoCD&#39;, &#39;Flux&#39;, &#39;Spinnaker&#39;];&#10;    artifact: &#39;Running Application&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  rbac: {&#10;    purpose: &#39;基于角色的访问控制&#39;;&#10;    tools: [&#39;OPA&#39;, &#39;Keycloak&#39;, &#39;LDAP&#39;];&#10;    artifact: &#39;Access Policies&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IDPComponents</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  applicationConfig</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    purpose</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '定义应用需要的资源和依赖'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    tools</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Score'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Helm Charts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Kustomize'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    artifact</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Workload Specification'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  infrastructureOrchestration</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    purpose</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '将声明式配置转化为实际资源'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    tools</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Terraform'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Crossplane'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Pulumi'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    artifact</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Provisioned Resources'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  environmentManagement</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    purpose</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '管理开发/预发/生产环境'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    tools</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Humanitec'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Backstage'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'自研'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    artifact</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Environment Instance'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  deploymentManagement</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    purpose</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '编排发布流程'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    tools</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ArgoCD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Flux'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Spinnaker'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    artifact</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Running Application'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  rbac</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    purpose</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '基于角色的访问控制'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    tools</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'OPA'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Keycloak'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'LDAP'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    artifact</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Access Policies'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这五个组件的协作方式遵循声明式原则：开发者描述&quot;我需要什么&quot;（应用配置），平台负责&quot;如何实现&quot;（编排和部署）。这与命令式的运维模式形成鲜明对比——开发者不再需要编写具体的资源创建步骤。</p>\n<p>每个组件都应该提供清晰的接口契约和版本管理。当底层实现变更时（比如从 AWS 迁移到 GCP），开发者的应用配置无需修改。</p>\n<h2 id=\"平台即产品思维\">平台即产品思维</h2><p>将平台视为产品而非项目，是 IDP 成功的关键思维转变。平台团队就是产品团队，内部开发者就是用户。这意味着需要用产品管理的方法论来运营平台。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"platform_product_management:&#10;  user_research:&#10;    methods:&#10;      - &#39;开发者访谈（每月至少 5 人）&#39;&#10;      - &#39;使用数据分析（漏斗分析、热图）&#39;&#10;      - &#39;NPS 净推荐值调查（季度）&#39;&#10;    persona:&#10;      - name: &#39;全栈开发者&#39;&#10;        pain: &#39;频繁在多个控制台间切换&#39;&#10;        gain: &#39;统一入口完成所有操作&#39;&#10;      - name: &#39;新入职开发者&#39;&#10;        pain: &#39;不知道用哪个工具、找不到文档&#39;&#10;        gain: &#39;黄金路径引导快速上手&#39;&#10;&#10;  product_roadmap:&#10;    prioritization: &#39;RICE 评分模型&#39;&#10;    release_cadence: &#39;双周迭代&#39;&#10;    feedback_loop: &#39;内部 Slack 频道 + 月度回顾&#39;&#10;&#10;  success_metrics:&#10;    - &#39;月活跃开发者数（MAU）&#39;&#10;    - &#39;自助完成率（无需人工介入）&#39;&#10;    - &#39;平均满意度评分&#39;&#10;    - &#39;功能采纳率&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">platform_product_management</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  user_research</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    methods</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'开发者访谈（每月至少 5 人）'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'使用数据分析（漏斗分析、热图）'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'NPS 净推荐值调查（季度）'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'全栈开发者'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        pain</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'频繁在多个控制台间切换'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        gain</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'统一入口完成所有操作'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'新入职开发者'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        pain</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'不知道用哪个工具、找不到文档'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        gain</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'黄金路径引导快速上手'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  product_roadmap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    prioritization</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RICE 评分模型'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    release_cadence</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'双周迭代'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    feedback_loop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'内部 Slack 频道 + 月度回顾'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  success_metrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'月活跃开发者数（MAU）'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'自助完成率（无需人工介入）'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'平均满意度评分'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'功能采纳率'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>产品思维的核心是&quot;可选但有吸引力&quot;。好的 IDP 不应该强制所有团队使用，而是通过卓越的体验让团队主动选择。这需要平台团队持续关注开发者痛点，优先解决高频问题，并建立快速反馈机制。</p>\n<p>对平台团队来说，内部 SLA 同样重要——自助操作的响应时间、平台可用性、问题修复速度都应该有明确承诺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"参考架构设计\">参考架构设计</h2><p>一个典型的 IDP 参考架构基于 Backstage 作为开发者门户，结合 GitOps 工作流和声明式基础设施管理。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 开发者交互&#10;        A[Backstage 门户]&#10;        B[CLI / SDK]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph GitOps 层&#10;        C[App Repo]&#10;        D[Platform Repo]&#10;        E[ArgoCD]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 基础设施层&#10;        F[Crossplane]&#10;        G[Kubernetes]&#10;        H[Cloud APIs]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt;|创建服务| C&#10;    A --&gt;|申请资源| D&#10;    B --&gt;|提交代码| C&#10;    C --&gt;|CI 触发| E&#10;    D --&gt;|资源声明| F&#10;    E --&gt;|部署应用| G&#10;    F --&gt;|创建资源| H&#10;    H --&gt;|状态同步| G\">graph LR\n    subgraph 开发者交互\n        A[Backstage 门户]\n        B[CLI / SDK]\n    end\n    subgraph GitOps 层\n        C[App Repo]\n        D[Platform Repo]\n        E[ArgoCD]\n    end\n    subgraph 基础设施层\n        F[Crossplane]\n        G[Kubernetes]\n        H[Cloud APIs]\n    end\n    A --&gt;|创建服务| C\n    A --&gt;|申请资源| D\n    B --&gt;|提交代码| C\n    C --&gt;|CI 触发| E\n    D --&gt;|资源声明| F\n    E --&gt;|部署应用| G\n    F --&gt;|创建资源| H\n    H --&gt;|状态同步| G</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 平台 API 服务示例：创建新微服务&#10;interface CreateServiceRequest {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  template: &#39;typescript-api&#39; | &#39;java-springboot&#39; | &#39;go-gin&#39;;&#10;  owner: string;&#10;  tier: &#39;critical&#39; | &#39;standard&#39; | &#39;experimental&#39;;&#10;  resources: {&#10;    database?: { type: &#39;postgresql&#39; | &#39;mysql&#39;; size: &#39;small&#39; | &#39;medium&#39; | &#39;large&#39; };&#10;    cache?: { type: &#39;redis&#39;; size: &#39;small&#39; | &#39;medium&#39; };&#10;    queue?: { type: &#39;rabbitmq&#39; | &#39;kafka&#39; };&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 平台编排：将请求转化为 GitOps 操作&#10;const createService = async (req: CreateServiceRequest) =&gt; {&#10;  const repo = await scaffoldFromTemplate(req.template, req.name);&#10;  const manifest = generateK8sManifest(req);&#10;  const crossplaneClaim = generateResourceClaim(req.resources);&#10;&#10;  await gitCommit(repo, manifest);&#10;  await gitCommit(&#39;platform-repo&#39;, crossplaneClaim);&#10;&#10;  return { repoUrl: repo.url, dashboardUrl: `${PORTAL}/services/${req.name}` };&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 平台 API 服务示例：创建新微服务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CreateServiceRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=